 another passage gives Y. Set support to that passage, fit=direct, observed_slot to the requested role, and counter empty unless there is actual negation or role exclusion. Examples with invented names: two albums both called Evening, one by Mira and one by Noel, support BOTH artists. Two people called Alex born1901 and1873 support BOTH dates. A player practicing golf AND tennis supports BOTH sports. A passage saying London is a birthplace makes London a wrong_argument for a birth-DATE question. Distinguish an asserted false same-role answer from a type error. Before wrong_argument, verify the source actually attributes a DIFFERENT role. Do not invent a disagreement or unknown conflict just to fill the field; differing allowed entities are not contradictions.\nInput: {\"question\": \"What is the profession of Peter Bergman?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0123-ea09880164cd:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 114, \"text\": \"Peter Bergman Peter Michael Bergman (born June 11, 1953) is an American actor best known for his portrayals as Dr.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0123-ea09880164cd:d00\", \"start\": 115, \"end\": 229, \"text\": \"Cliff Warner on \\\"All My Children\\\" (1979–89) as well as Jack Abbott on \\\"The Young and the Restless\\\" (1989–present).\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0123-ea09880164cd:d00\", \"start\": 230, \"end\": 323, \"text\": \"The son of Walter Bergman, a United States Navy officer, he was born in Guantanamo Bay, Cuba.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0123-ea09880164cd:d00\", \"start\": 324, \"end\": 403, \"text\": \"He later graduated from Crossland Senior High School in Camp Springs, Maryland.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0123-ea09880164cd:d00\", \"start\": 404, \"end\": 472, \"text\": \"Bergman was married to actress Christine Ebersole from 1976 to 1981.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0123-ea09880164cd:d00\", \"start\": 473, \"end\": 534, \"text\": \"In 1985, he married Mariellen, with whom he has two children.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0123-ea09880164cd:d00\", \"start\": 535, \"end\": 598, \"text\": \"Bergman originally auditioned for the \\\"All My Children\\\" role of\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0123-ea09880164cd:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 328, \"text\": \"the Restless 35th Anniversary : Cast & Creators Live at the Paley Center Guest Show 2010 The Talk Guest Talk 2010 SOAPnet Selects : The Best of '06 Actor Show 2006 Entertainment Tonight Canada Guest Show 2005 The King of Queens Stream Guest Star Series 1998 ABC Soaps ' Most Unforgettable Love Stories Actor Show 1998 The 5 Mrs.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0123-ea09880164cd:d01\", \"start\": 329, \"end\": 559, \"text\": \"Buchanans Guest Star Show 1994 The Nanny Stream Guest Star Series 1993 Woman on the Ledge Actor Bob Movie 1993 Palomino Actor Warren Taylor Movie 1991 The Bold and the Beautiful Stream Actor Jack Abbott Soap 1987 The Young and the\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0123-ea09880164cd:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 164, \"text\": \"Peter Bergman (comedian) Peter Paul Bergman (November 29, 1939 – March 9, 2012) was an American writer and comedian, best known as a member of The Firesign Theatre.\"}, \"D3S2\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0123-ea09880164cd:d02\", \"start\": 165, \"end\": 178, \"text\": \"He played Lt.\"}, \"D3S3\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0123-ea09880164cd:d02\", \"start\": 179, \"end\": 214, \"text\": \"Bradshaw in the Nick Danger series.\"}, \"D3S4\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0123-ea09880164cd:d02\", \"start\": 215, \"end\": 334, \"text\": \"He was born in Cleveland, Ohio and graduated from Shaker Heights High School in the Cleveland suburb of Shaker Heights.\"}, \"D3S5\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0123-ea09880164cd:d02\", \"start\": 335, \"end\": 421, \"text\": \"The Firesign Theatre was formed as a result of Bergman's show \\\"Radio Free Oz\\\" on KPFK.\"}, \"D3S6\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0123-ea09880164cd:d02\", \"start\": 422, \"end\": 482, \"text\": \"According to Bergman, \\\"I started July 24th, 1966 on KPFK ...\"}, \"D3S7\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0123-ea09880164cd:d02\", \"start\": 483, \"end\": 581, \"text\": \"I had some very interesting people around me, which those folks became The Firesign Theatre: David\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0123-ea09880164cd:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0123-ea09880164cd:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"Peter Bergman\", \"scope\": \"profession\", \"claim\": \"Peter Bergman is an actor.\", \"answer\": \"actor\", \"quote\": \"Peter Bergman Peter Michael Bergman (born June 11, 1953) is an American actor best known for his portrayals as Dr.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0123-ea09880164cd:d02\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0123-ea09880164cd:d02:c0\", \"entity\": \"Peter Bergman\", \"scope\": \"profession\", \"claim\": \"Peter Bergman's profession is comedian.\", \"answer\": \"comedian\", \"quote\": \"Peter Bergman (comedian) Peter Paul Bergman (November 29, 1939 – March 9, 2012) was an American writer and comedian, best known as a member of The Firesign Theatre.\", \"original_document_number\": 3}], \"R5_answers\": [\"actor\", \"comedian\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"actor\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"comedian\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
